# Custom Plan post-completion card-stat rows

Add five resource-stat rows after any ordered construction-step rows in every expanded custom plan.

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] Every expanded custom plan shows exactly five post-completion card-stat rows.
- [x] Rows appear in Brick, Wood, Hay, Sheep, Ore order and use the shared resource icons without redundant names.
- [x] A clearly associated fixed-pane label identifies the group as `Card stats after plan completion`.
- [x] For Construction plans, the complete ordered Steps section appears before the card-stat section.
- [x] Cards-only plans omit Steps and begin directly with card-stat rows.
- [x] Each resource row uses the same summary and probability columns as plan/step rows.
- [x] Fixed resource rows and scrolling values remain vertically aligned while expanding, collapsing, scrolling, and switching table sections.
- [x] Placeholder card statistics are deterministic, player-aware, hand-aware where applicable, and red until simulation output exists.
- [x] Ownership dots and All-player filtering from TASK-027 remain correct for expanded plans.
- [x] Stable row identities prevent animation collisions between resources or different plans.
- [x] Domain row-model and UI regression coverage compile.
- [ ] Focused animation/alignment checks pass on a functioning simulator.

## Scope notes

- This task consumes TASK-029's expandable hierarchy and must not create a second independent expansion implementation.

## Evidence

- Extended TASK-029's shared hierarchy with one card-stat group and five stable resource rows for every expanded custom plan.
- Construction plans insert ordered Steps first; cards-only plans begin directly with card statistics.
- Resource placeholders are deterministic and vary with owner, plan contents, and the applicable resource hand.
- Fixed icon rows and scrolling summary/probability rows use the same flattened identities and 44-point heights.
- Domain tests assert exact resource order and placeholder inputs; UI coverage asserts five rows, vertical alignment, and collapse.
- `xcodebuild build-for-testing` compiled the app and both test bundles using `/private/tmp/Catanalyst-tasks025-030-derived`; live animation checks remain manual.
